            {
              "position": 3,
              "updatedAt": "2024-04-29T09:21:31.549Z",
              "id": 7,
              "title": "TechCorp TruckBrand",
              "slug": "techcorp-truckbrand",
              "websiteUrl": "https://truckbrand-techcorp.com/",
              "short_description_id": "deskripsi data intel 2",
              "short_description_en": "data intel 2 description",
              "about_id": "TechCorp International Inc - Truck Sales Operation atau biasa dikenal dengan TechCorp TruckBrand merupakan jaringan penjualan, perawatan, dan perbaikan serta penyediaan suku cadang untuk produk TruckBrand yang berdiri sejak tahun 1990. Saat ini TechCorp TruckBrand merupakan yang terbesar Dealer TruckBrand di Indonesia yang menguasai sekitar 45 persen dari total penjualan TruckBrand. Dalam kegiatan usahanya, TechCorp TruckBrand bekerjasama dengan PT TruckBrand TechCorp Motor Indonesia yang merupakan agen tunggal pemegang merek TruckBrand atau ATPM.\n\nSebagai jasa reparasi kendaraan TruckBrand, mereka perlu memprediksi siapa saja calon pelanggan churn. Dukungan tim TechCorp Data Intelligence dengan memanfaatkan transaksi layanan historis yang ada dan mengembangkan pembelajaran mesin. Oleh karena itu, TechCorp TruckBrand mampu melakukan pendekatan inisiatif dengan membuat strategi kampanye dan membidik segmen.",
              "about_en": "TechCorp International Inc - Truck Sales Operation or commonly known as TechCorp TruckBrand is a network of sales, maintenance, and repair services as well as the supply of spare parts for TruckBrand products, which was established in 1990. Currently, TechCorp TruckBrand is the largest TruckBrand dealer in Indonesia, which controls about 45 percent of TruckBrands total sales. In its business activities, TechCorp TruckBrand is associated with PT TruckBrand TechCorp Motor Indonesia is the sole agent for the TruckBrand brand holder or ATPM.\n\nAs the repair services for TruckBrand vehicles, they need to predict who are potential churn customers. TechCorp Data Intelligence team support by utilizing existing historical service transaction and develop machine learning. Therefore, TechCorp TruckBrand able to do initiative approach by create campaign strategy and have targeted segment.",
              "year": 2024,
              "ifHasDetail": true,
              "logo": {
