            {
              "position": 4,
              "updatedAt": "2024-04-29T03:19:55.671Z",
              "id": 28,
              "title": "Movic 3",
              "slug": "movic-3",
              "websiteUrl": "https://movic.id/",
              "short_description_id": "deskripsi data intel 4",
              "short_description_en": "data intel 4 description",
              "about_id": "Movic adalah platform digital berupa aplikasi mobile yang memberikan kemudahan untuk segala kebutuhan transportasi pelanggan. Mulai dari sewa mobil, sewa mobil dengan supir, antar jemput bandara, sewa mobil instan per 1 jam, hingga booking bus & tiket travel, semua bisa dilakukan dengan Movic. \n\nSejak tahun 2018, Movic hadir sebagai solusi kebutuhan mobilitas transportasi di Indonesia dan kini telah menjangkau 60 kota di Indonesia.\n\nTim Intelijen Data TechCorp mengambil bagian dalam perjalanan mereka dengan mendukung pemantauan kinerja bisnis dan metrik penting lainnya secara realtime sambil mengaktifkan pelaporan otomatis.",
              "about_en": "Movic is a digital platform in the form of mobile application that provides easiness for all customers transportation needs. Starting from car rental, car rental with driver, airport transfer, instant car rental per 1 hour, to booking bus & travel tickets, all can be done with Movic. \n\nSince 2018, Movic has been present as a solution for transportation mobility needs in Indonesia and now, they are reaching 60 cities in Indonesia.\n\nTechCorp Data Intelligence Team took part in their journey by supporting in monitoring business performance and any other important metrics in a realtime whilst enabling automatic reporting.",
              "year": 2024,
              "ifHasDetail": true,
