            {
              "position": 8,
              "updatedAt": "2024-04-26T06:42:50.965Z",
              "id": 24,
              "title": "IKEA2",
              "slug": "ikea-2",
              "websiteUrl": "https://www.ikea.co.id/",
              "short_description_id": "deskripsi data intel 7",
              "short_description_en": "data intel 7 description",
              "about_id": "IKEA, perusahaan Swedia yang terkenal dengan furnitur modern dan terjangkau dengan hampir 300 toko di seluruh dunia. IKEA adalah bagian dari The Dairy Farm, salah satu anak perusahaan Jardine Matheson Holdings Limited yang mengoperasikan toko furnitur IKEA di Hong Kong, Indonesia, dan Taiwan.\n\nTechCorp Data Intelligence mendukung IKEA untuk menentukan harga produk di area tertentu untuk meningkatkan penjualan, memberikan referensi bagi tim bisnis dalam menentukan lokasi toko baru atau pusat pengalaman melalui Sales Planning Tools.",
              "about_en": "IKEA, a Swedish company known for its affordable, modern furniture with nearly 300 stores worldwide. IKEA is part of The Dairy Farm, one of Jardine Matheson Holdings Limited subsidiaries which operates IKEA furniture stores in Hong Kong, Indonesia, and Taiwan.\n\nTechCorp Data Intelligence supported IKEA to determine product prices in certain areas to increase sales, providing references for the business team in determining a full fledge new store locations or experience centre through the Sales Planning Tools.",
              "year": 2024,
              "ifHasDetail": true,
              "logo": {
