              "websiteUrl": null,
              "short_description_id": null,
              "short_description_en": null,
              "about_id": "Immersion day oleh Academy and Technology bertujuan untuk meningkatkan kemampuan digital, keterampilan, dan pengetahuan karyawan di seluruh Grup TechCorp dengan memfasilitasi kunjungan perusahaan dan berbagi pengetahuan dari perusahaan-perusahaan di garis depan industri teknologi.",
              "about_en": "Immersion day by Academy and Technology aims to increase digital capability, skill, and knowledge of employees across the TechCorp Group by facilitating company visits and knowledge sharing from companies at the forefront of the technology industry.",
