              "websiteUrl": null,
              "short_description_id": null,
              "short_description_en": null,
              "about_id": "Inisiatif TechCorp untuk mengakselerasi inovasi dan digitalisasi di Grup TechCorp melalui pemberdayaan startup. TechCorp Innovation Lab menyediakan program akselerasi intensif selama 12 minggu untuk mendukung startup tahap awal dalam mengembangkan produknya.",
              "about_en": "TechCorp initiative to accelerate innovation and digitalization in TechCorp Group through empowering startups. TechCorp Innovation Lab provides a 12-weeks intensive acceleration program to support early-stage startups in developing their product.",
