              "id": 14,
              "title": "Halodoc",
              "slug": "halodoc",
              "websiteUrl": "https://www.halodoc.com/",
              "short_description_id": null,
              "short_description_en": null,
              "about_id": "Startup HealthTech yang menghubungkan pengguna aplikasi ke jaringan dokter berlisensi, apotek mitra bersertifikat, dan layanan laboratorium medis berlisensi.\n\nTechCorp memimpin sebagai investor utama untuk penggalangan dana Seri C Halodoc pada April 2021.\n\nAsuransi TechCorp bersama Halodoc meluncurkan produk asuransi kesehatan digital, Garda Healthtech, yang dapat dibeli dengan mudah melalui aplikasi.",
              "about_en": "HealthTech start-up which connects app-users to a network of licensed doctors, certified partner pharmacies and licensed medical laboratory service.\n\nTechCorp served as the lead investor for Halodocs Series C fundraising in April 2021.\n\nAsuransi TechCorp together with Halodoc launched a digital health insurance product, Garda Healthtech, which can easily be purchased in-app.",
              "year": 2024,
              "ifHasDetail": true,
              "logo": {
