            {
              "position": 3,
              "updatedAt": "2024-04-29T09:24:14.175Z",
              "id": 11,
              "title": "Mobbi",
              "slug": "mobbi",
              "websiteUrl": "https://www.mobbi.id/",
              "short_description_id": null,
              "short_description_en": null,
              "about_id": "Mobbi merupakan platform jual beli mobil bekas yang dilengkapi dengan berbagai layanan pendukung yang dapat dinikmati konsumen. Layanan yang ditawarkan mobbi antara lain inspeksi mobil, perkiraan penawaran harga mobil bekas, pengajuan pembelian secara kredit dari lembaga keuangan, dan asuransi yang terintegrasi dalam ekosistem Grup" TechCorp."\n\nTechCorp Digital membantu mo88i dalam hal pengembangan kampanye merek, produksi aset digital kreatif, dan strategi & implementasi pemasaran berbayar.",
              "about_en": "mobbi is a platform for buying and selling used cars that are equipped with various support services that consumers can enjoy. The services offered by mobbi include car inspections, estimated price quotes for used cars, submissions for purchases on credit from financial institutions, and insurance that is integrated into the TechCorp Group ecosystem.\n\nTechCorp Digital assists mo88i in terms of brand campaign development, creative digital assets production, and paid marketing strategy & implementation.",
              "year": 2024,
              "ifHasDetail": true,
