            {
              "position": 4,
              "updatedAt": "2024-04-29T09:24:50.804Z",
              "id": 12,
              "title": "TechCorp Property",
              "slug": "techcorp-property",
              "websiteUrl": "https://techcorpproperty.com/en/",
              "short_description_id": null,
              "short_description_en": null,
              "about_id": "TechCorp Property adalah bisnis pengembangan, pengelolaan, dan investasi properti dengan portofolio terdiversifikasi yang terintegrasi. TechCorp Property memiliki proyek diversifikasi yang meliputi International Grade A Office Tower dengan sertifikasi Greenmark Platinum yang merupakan sertifikasi tertinggi dalam kategori green building, apartemen dengan konsep premium dan mewah, rumah hunian dengan konsep hunian di tepi danau dan jasa manajemen properti yang mengutamakan keunggulan operasional dan pelayanan.\n\nTechCorp Digital membantu TechCorp Property dalam hal pengembangan kampanye merek, produksi aset digital kreatif, dan strategi & implementasi pemasaran berbayar.",
              "about_en": "TechCorp Property is a property development, management, and investment business with integrated diversified portfolios. TechCorp Property has diversification projects that includes International Grade A Office Tower with Greenmark Platinum certification which is the highest certification in the green building category, apartment with premium and luxury concept, residential landed house with dwelling concept on the shores of the lake and property management services which prioritizes operational and service excellences.\n\nTechCorp Digital assists TechCorp Property in terms of brand campaign development, creative digital assets production, and paid marketing strategy & implementation.",
              "year": 2024,
              "ifHasDetail": true,
              "logo": {
